-    //the ROM has had time to drive it, real hardware reads back garbage (open bus), and
-    //the ROM must not answer. Reference points, in (LAT, PWD) form:
-    //  retail cartridges (header 80 37 12 40):   (0x40, 0x12) => 1040ns + 304ns
